  <p>Our site contains links to external websites over whose content we have no influence. The respective provider or operator is always responsible for the content of linked pages. The linked pages were checked for possible legal violations at the time of linking; permanent monitoring of linked pages is not reasonable without concrete indications of an infringement. If we become aware of infringements, we will remove such links immediately.</p>

